**🎲 Something in the Dark (Longsword) — rolls 6. MISS! Blade screams past your ear, sparks trailing from stone.**

The creature emerges from between the pillars — humanoid but wrong, its movements jerking and unnatural like a puppet on tangled strings. Corroded armor hangs from its shoulders. In its grip, a longsword that sings with rust and hunger. It lunges again, but desperation makes it wild; the blade clangs against the stone floor where you stood a heartbeat before. Its hollow socket-eyes fix on you with terrible intent.


