**🎲 Longsword (d20+2) — rolls 21. HIT! 1d8+3 = 7 slashing. Something in the Dark (14/22 HP)**

The creature wrenches its blade free from the stone with a sound like tearing flesh. It pivots, wild-eyed, and its own weapon catches it across the shoulder — a glancing wound that opens corroded armor and spills more of that dark, viscous fluid. The creature staggers, confused by its own savagery. For a heartbeat, it seems almost *uncertain*, as if something deep within that hollow frame is struggling against the thing that wears it.

Then it turns back toward you, breathing hard, sword raised. Still dangerous. Still hungry.


