**🎲 Longsword (d20+2) — rolls 11. MISS! Blade clangs uselessly against stone.**

The creature's swing is wild, unfocused — as if something inside it is *fighting* itself. The sword scrapes across the pillar beside you, throwing sparks. For just a moment, you see something flicker behind those hollow eyes: a glimmer of consciousness, perhaps, or the last dying ember of whatever this thing once was. Then it passes. The creature hisses and raises its blade again, ready to strike.

The corroded warrior stands before you, bleeding dark fluid, breathing hard. Its sword drips. Waiting for your move.


